1
00:00:01,279 --> 00:00:02,849
Previously on
The Big Bang Theory...

2
00:00:02,847 --> 00:00:04,957
Oh, look at all
that chest hair.

3
00:00:05,058 --> 00:00:06,088
And overbite.

4
00:00:06,092 --> 00:00:07,922
Of course you're a Wolowitz.

5
00:00:09,729 --> 00:00:12,259
Son of a bitch, he bit me.

6
00:00:12,265 --> 00:00:15,705
Okay, I guess I'll just go to
the emergency room to be safe.

7
00:00:15,702 --> 00:00:18,472
Howie, this is just
your hypochondria.

8
00:00:18,471 --> 00:00:20,801
When I sat on the mute button
and thought I'd gone deaf,

9
00:00:20,807 --> 00:00:22,637
that was my hypochondria.

10
00:00:31,418 --> 00:00:34,918
We'll find another time
to tell him I'm pregnant.

11
00:00:38,858 --> 00:00:40,188
(Howard:)Morning.

12
00:00:40,193 --> 00:00:41,493
(Howard:)Morning.

13
00:00:41,494 --> 00:00:43,164
"We"?

14
00:00:43,163 --> 00:00:44,563
(Howard:)What is this?

15
00:00:44,564 --> 00:00:45,764
(Bernadette:)I don't know.

16
00:00:45,765 --> 00:00:47,365
(Bernadette:)Maybe it says
something on the back.

17
00:00:48,935 --> 00:00:51,905
"Continued on milk."

18
00:00:51,905 --> 00:00:53,975
(Howard:)If you're tricking me
into making my own breakfast,

19
00:00:53,973 --> 00:00:56,143
(Howard:)it didn't work for my mom,
and it won't work for you.

20
00:00:57,944 --> 00:00:58,944
"Are."

21
00:00:58,945 --> 00:01:01,615
"We are..."

